Origin
------
This theme is original work. Its stylesheet, templates, scripts, logo and
icons were written for Vantage; no code, markup, styles or artwork were
copied from other LuCI themes (Bootstrap, Material, Argon, OpenWrt 2020,
UniWRT or others). The status icons are drawn by dev/icons/build.js in the
Vantage source tree.

The theme targets LuCI, the OpenWrt web interface (https://github.com/openwrt/luci),
which is itself licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It uses LuCI's public
interfaces only - the template scope, luci.js (L, E, ui.menu, rpc), the
luci.themes/luci.main.mediaurlbase configuration and the CSS classes that
LuCI's views emit - and ships no LuCI source. The package is built with
LuCI's luci.mk.
